{"id":"rustKeyword","name":"Rust: Keyword","description":"Rust 关键字","level":"代码练习","cover":"💻","category":"代码练习","language":"code","words":[{"id":"rustKeyword_00001","word":"as","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"`as` 用于进行类型转换（类型别名），将一种类型转换为另一种类型，通常用于强制类型转换或者是简化泛型。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"rustKeyword"},{"id":"rustKeyword_00002","word":"async","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"`async` 用于定义异步函数或闭包，表示该函数将返回一个 `Future`，可以通过 `await` 来等待其执行结果。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"rustKeyword"},{"id":"rustKeyword_00003","word":"await","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"`await` 用于在异步上下文中等待异步操作的完成。它只能在 `async` 函数中使用。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"rustKeyword"},{"id":"rustKeyword_00004","word":"break","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"`break` 用于跳出当前的循环或 `match` 语句，终止循环或匹配。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"rustKeyword"},{"id":"rustKeyword_00005","word":"const","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"`const` 用于定义常量，其值在编译时就已经确定，并且值不可变。常量的类型必须显式指定。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"rustKeyword"},{"id":"rustKeyword_00006","word":"continue","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"`continue` 用于跳过当前循环的剩余部分，继续执行下一次循环。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"rustKeyword"},{"id":"rustKeyword_00007","word":"crate","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"`crate` 表示当前包（crate），用于标识模块或外部 crate 的路径。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"rustKeyword"},{"id":"rustKeyword_00008","word":"dyn","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"`dyn` 用于创建 trait 对象，允许在运行时动态调用 trait 中定义的方法。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"rustKeyword"},{"id":"rustKeyword_00009","word":"else","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"`else` 用于与 `if` 语句配合，指定条件不成立时执行的代码块。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"rustKeyword"},{"id":"rustKeyword_00010","word":"enum","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"`enum` 用于定义枚举类型，枚举可以有多个变体，每个变体可以包含不同类型的数据。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"rustKeyword"},{"id":"rustKeyword_00011","word":"extern","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"`extern` 用于声明外部函数或外部库（通常是 C 或其他语言），以便可以在 Rust 代码中调用。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"rustKeyword"},{"id":"rustKeyword_00012","word":"fn","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"`fn` 用于定义函数。函数有一个明确的返回类型（如果有的话），并且可以接受参数。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"rustKeyword"},{"id":"rustKeyword_00013","word":"for","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"`for` 用于创建一个迭代循环，通常用来遍历集合、范围或其他可迭代的类型。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"rustKeyword"},{"id":"rustKeyword_00014","word":"if","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"`if` 用于执行条件判断语句，如果条件为真，则执行对应代码块。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"rustKeyword"},{"id":"rustKeyword_00015","word":"impl","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"`impl` 用于为类型（如结构体、枚举或 trait）实现方法，或者为类型实现某个 trait。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"rustKeyword"},{"id":"rustKeyword_00016","word":"in","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"`in` 用于模式匹配中，表示模式的匹配条件。通常与 `for` 循环一起使用。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"rustKeyword"},{"id":"rustKeyword_00017","word":"let","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"`let` 用于声明变量或常量，常用来进行值绑定，支持可变和不可变绑定。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"rustKeyword"},{"id":"rustKeyword_00018","word":"loop","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"`loop` 用于创建一个无限循环，直到使用 `break` 或其他控制流语句终止。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"rustKeyword"},{"id":"rustKeyword_00019","word":"match","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"`match` 用于模式匹配，根据给定的值匹配多个可能的情况并执行相应的代码块。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"rustKeyword"},{"id":"rustKeyword_00020","word":"mod","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"`mod` 用于定义模块，模块是组织代码的基本单元，包含函数、结构体、枚举等内容。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"rustKeyword"},{"id":"rustKeyword_00021","word":"move","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"`move` 用于捕获闭包中的值时，强制将其所有权转移给闭包，而非通过引用传递。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"rustKeyword"},{"id":"rustKeyword_00022","word":"mut","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"`mut` 用于声明一个可变变量或可变引用，表示该变量的值可以被修改。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"rustKeyword"},{"id":"rustKeyword_00023","word":"pub","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"`pub` 用于将项（如结构体、函数或模块）标记为公有，使得它们可以在模块外部访问。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"rustKeyword"},{"id":"rustKeyword_00024","word":"ref","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"`ref` 用于通过引用模式匹配值，避免值的所有权转移，而是获取一个引用。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"rustKeyword"},{"id":"rustKeyword_00025","word":"return","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"`return` 用于从函数中返回值，终止函数执行并返回控制权给调用者。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"rustKeyword"},{"id":"rustKeyword_00026","word":"self","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"`self` 表示当前实例，在方法定义中引用调用该方法的对象。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"rustKeyword"},{"id":"rustKeyword_00027","word":"static","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"`static` 用于声明具有静态生命周期的变量，这些变量在程序的整个生命周期中都存在。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"rustKeyword"},{"id":"rustKeyword_00028","word":"struct","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"`struct` 用于定义结构体类型，它是一种自定义的数据类型，可以包含多个字段。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"rustKeyword"},{"id":"rustKeyword_00029","word":"super","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"`super` 用于引用父模块，通常用于访问父模块中的函数或类型。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"rustKeyword"},{"id":"rustKeyword_00030","word":"trait","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"`trait` 用于定义 trait，它是一组方法签名，可以被不同的类型实现以提供共享功能。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"rustKeyword"},{"id":"rustKeyword_00031","word":"type","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"`type` 用于定义类型别名，或者在泛型中为类型参数指定约束条件。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"rustKeyword"},{"id":"rustKeyword_00032","word":"unsafe","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"`unsafe` 用于标记不安全的代码块，允许进行一些编译器不检查的操作，如直接操作指针等。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"rustKeyword"},{"id":"rustKeyword_00033","word":"use","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"`use` 用于将模块、函数、类型等引入当前作用域，减少代码冗余并简化访问路径。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"rustKeyword"},{"id":"rustKeyword_00034","word":"where","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"`where` 用于在泛型约束中指定类型约束，通常用于定义函数或结构体时的类型参数约束。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"rustKeyword"},{"id":"rustKeyword_00035","word":"while","phonetic":"","pos":"—","meaning":"`while` 用于创建一个基于条件判断的循环，只要条件为真，循环就会继续执行。","example":"","exampleZh":"","tags":[],"bookId":"rustKeyword"}]}